        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ijaka ŋul kodumanakinete eka baka Solomon inyamat, nepepe kanul kere da luapote omesa loka ekabaka Solomon, ŋinituŋanan olapake: mam ibore kere yenabu kokurwok, ",
